  "body": "I don't know where the right place is for meta viewport -- maybe here. Maybe somewhere else. That said, Fennec got a bug report that had a weird thing:\n\n`<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=0\">`\n\nShould figure out how Blink/Safari handle that and define it somewhere. @frivoal, do you guys document meta viewport in [CSS Device Adapatation](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-device-adapt/)?\n\ncf. https://github.com/webcompat/web-bugs/issues/2293\n",
